  "description": "Tucked away in a peaceful location and positioned right beside a local park, this charming home offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience and outdoor living.<br/><br/>Step inside to discover a well-designed 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home that's complemented by an exceptional backyard rarely found in properties of this size. Whether you're entertaining under the covered patio, tending to your herb garden, picking fresh fruit from the mature trees or simply enjoying the open lawn, this home offers a lifestyle that's hard to beat.<br/><br/>Perfect for families, couples and pet owners alike, you'll love having a large, low-maintenance backyard with plenty of space to enjoy, while the neighbouring park and playground provide an extension of your own outdoor space.<br/><br/>What You'll Adore!<br/><br/>• Two spacious bedrooms and a functional bathroom<br/><br/>• Expansive backyard featuring a covered patio, paved entertaining area, established lawn, mature fruit trees, herb garden and garden shed<br/><br/>• Pet-friendly home with plenty of secure outdoor space for the whole family to enjoy<br/><br/>• Single carport plus an additional off-street parking space directly in front of the property<br/><br/>• Quiet location positioned immediately beside a park and children's playground, with shops, cafés, public transport and the Perth CBD all within easy reach<br/><br/>Offering the space of a larger home with the convenience of a sought-after Maylands location, this is an opportunity not to be missed.<br/><br/>AVAILABLE 11/08/2026<br/><br/>HOW TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY<br/>Arranging an inspection is easy. Simply click the “Make an Enquiry” or “Email Agent” button on the rental property listing and enter your details. Our system will then send you an email requesting that you register your details so you can receive inspection updates and register your enquiry.<br/><br/>You can then choose to join an existing inspection time or contact the agent to arrange a new 